    <Major>Archer macro to hit like a machinegun</Major>
    <Description>This macro is designed to enhance your damage output, allowing you to deliver up to 400% of your damage within a short time frame of 1.4 seconds. It incorporates a random delay method to minimize detection by anti-cheat systems such as Hotshield.
This macro is designed to enhance your damage output, allowing you to deliver up to 400% of your damage within a short time frame of 1.4 seconds. It incorporates a random delay method to minimize detection by anti-cheat systems such as Hotshield.

Features:

  - Damage Boost: Efficiently executes commands to maximize damage output within the specified time window.
  - Anti-Detection Measures: Utilizes random delays to reduce the likelihood of detection.
   -Toggle Activation: Operates with an ON/OFF toggle system. Activate or deactivate the macro by pressing the assigned button.
    -Animation Canceling: While the macro is active, walking left and right cancels animations, which is essential for optimal performance.
    -Auto-Movement Option: Includes an automated movement feature, which requires tuning for compatibility with different game patches.

This macro has been tested on main servers and private servers, including 4Vision, 4Legacy, and 4Classic.

How to use:
1-Assign the macro to a convenient key or button
2-Asaign the ABB skills of the Archer to the KEYs (1,2,3,7) (Battle Arrow,Normal Attack, Explosive Arrow, Merciless Shot)
3-Press the assigned button to activate the macro.(firing 4 arrows pew pew pew pew, and you still can use your Blind Arrow skill as a 5th shot. it wasn't included in the macro in case you use it defencely)
4-make sure to turn it off once you kill your Enemies or Dead</Description>
